#. module: sale_order_blanket_order_stock_prebook
msgid "At Order Confirmation"
msgstr "Al confirmar el pedido"

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order_stock_prebook
msgid "Reservation Strategy"
msgstr "Estrategia de reserva"

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order_stock_prebook
msgid "Sales Order"
msgstr "Pedido de venta"

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order_stock_prebook
msgid "Sales Order Line"
msgstr "Línea de pedido de venta"

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order_stock_prebook
msgid ""
"Specifies when the stock should be reserved for the blanket order.  When the strategy "
"is 'At Order Confirmation', the stock is reserved when the blanket order is confirmed. "
"When the strategy is 'At Call-off', the stock is reserved when the call-off order is "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Indica cuándo se reservan las existencias del pedido marco. Con «Al confirmar el "
"pedido» se reservan al confirmar el pedido marco; con «En la liberación» se reservan al"
" confirmar el pedido de liberación."

